#: ../../../user/hardware/certified-hardware/nitropc-pro-2.rst:10
#: 4bd17ed6e7b54fe480b1309ba15dfb7e
msgid ""
"**Note:** When configuring your NitroPC Pro 2 on the Nitrokey website, there "
"is an option for a discrete graphics card (e.g., Nvidia GeForce RTX 4070 or "
"4090) in addition to integrated graphics (e.g., Intel UHD 770, which is "
"always included because it is physically built into the CPU). NitroPC Pro 2 "
"configurations that include discrete graphics cards are *not* Qubes-"
"certified. The only NitroPC Pro 2 configurations that are Qubes-certified "
"are those that contain *only* integrated graphics."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/hardware/certified-hardware/nitropc-pro-2.rst:14
#: bad58b71acff481e9480079979f4bbe7
msgid ""
"**Note:** Only the “Dasharo TianoCore UEFI without Measured Boot, without "
"Nitrokey” firmware option is certified. The “HEADS with Measured Boot, "
"requires Nitrokey!” firmware option is *not* certified."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/hardware/certified-hardware/nitropc-pro-2.rst:16
#: 9d6fd021dd0a455787ffc6a0c5db5c5a
msgid ""
"The `NitroPC Pro 2 <https://shop.nitrokey.com/shop/nitropc-pro-2-523>`__ is :"
"doc:`officially certified </user/hardware/certified-hardware/certified-"
"hardware>` for Qubes OS Release 4."
msgstr ""

